            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Not federally for 2026 installs. The 25C credit, which paid 30 percent up to $600 for qualifying gas tankless heaters, ended for property placed in service after December 31, 2025. You can still claim it for a 2025 installation on your 2025 return. Check current IRS guidance and your gas utility for rebates."
          }
        },
