            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Professional descaling typically costs $150 to $350 a year. Doing it yourself costs a one-time $60 to $120 for a pump and hoses, then a few dollars of solution annually. Hard water may also justify a scale filter or softener. Condensing units need occasional neutraliser media, usually $20 to $60 every few years."
          }
